(if: $eventShow's timer is 1 or it is 0)[
	<li>(link: "Consider leaving for the Greeting Gala.")[
    	(goto: "Gala A")<!--[[Gala A]]-->
    ] <span class="desc">(You're thinking about it...)</span>
<br>
Or...]

