<!--Dream I, toilet dream, warning about Henri; mirror Henri F's trigger conditions, minus -1 day-->
(if: $lockDreamG is true and $eventParty's timer < -3 and $lockHenriF is false and $waitMorning2 is 1 and $lockDreamI is false)[(goto: "Dream I")]<!--[[Dream I]]-->

<!--Dream H, warning about not opening the door; mirror Amy B's trigger conditions-->
(if: $lockDreamG is true and $lockDreamAmy1 is true and $lockAmyB is false and $skipMidday2 is false and $lockDreamH is false)[(goto: "Dream H")]<!--[[Dream H]]-->

<!--Shaken dream, right after meeting with Amy-->
(if: $shakenHenriG is true and $lockDreamAmy1 is false)[(goto: "Dream Amy 1")]<!--[[Dream Amy 1]]-->

