:: Jesse C1 {"position":"5950,1700","size":"100,100"}
{=

(if: $time is "Morning")[

(set: $activity to "looking for Jesse")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

You call out to Jesse.
<br>
//"Miu..."// she answers meekly, voice full of hurt. Where is she?
<br>
You suspect that she's hiding on top of the wardrobe, where there are fewer ants. At least you hope that's the case.
<br>
---
<ol>
<li>~~Spend time with Jesse~~ <span class="desc">(She's shy about the ants. You'll have to do something about that.)</span>
<li>(link: "You should get on with your morning.")[(print: $actionBack's effect)]
<span class="desc">(print: $actionBack's desc)</span>
]

(if: $time is "Evening")[

(set: $activity to "observing Jesse")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

Jesse must be sleeping.
<br>
About an hour ago, she left her hiding place for a quick bite. The second she hopped away, you emptied and cleaned the bowl. You take better of her than yourself. But not enough.
<br>
You've thought about leaving the kibble bowl on top of the wardrobe for her to eat at her leisure, but you can't risk the ants invading the last safe place in the apartment.
<br>
The best thing you can do for her is to do what you should have done all along.
<br>
---
(link: "Go. What are you waiting for?")[(print: $actionBack's effect)]
<span class="desc">(print: $actionBack's desc)</span>
]


:: Jesse C3 {"position":"5950,2000","size":"100,100"}
{=

<!--Jesse got attacked again and is now in hiding-->

(set: $activity to "observing Jesse in hiding")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

Jesse is hiding from the ants.
<br>
You can't get close enough to her, but looking from afar, you can see pink patches of missing fur all over her face and body, with new sores open and weeping. A few ants are crawling in her fur.
<br>
Her whiskers droop, and she is hyperventilating. She does not look at you when you call her. She hates you. (link-rerun: "You've done this to her.")[(either:
(dialog: [If only you were better at what you do and could afford a better place, she wouldn't have been in this state.], "But wealth isn't always rewarded to talent."),
(dialog: [If only you weren't such a slob, the ants wouldn't have been there in the first place.], "What if the ants have always been here?"),
(dialog: [If only she had never met you…], "And what? Lie down next to her cold siblings in that carton box?"),
(dialog: [If only you'd leave the door open; she might have better chances out there.], "Would the streets be kinder to her? For how many years?"),
(dialog: [If only you've been thorough, the ants would never have returned.], "But you thought you were thorough, didn't you?"),
(dialog: [If only you had someone else with you, someone to watch your back while you slept....], "But you already have Jesse."),
)] 
<br>
It's too late for what-ifs, but it's not too late to do the right thing.
<br>
---
<ol>
You…
<li>~~Play with Jesse.~~ <span class="desc">(That's out of the question until the ants are gone.)</span>

<li>~~Take her to the vet.~~ <span class="desc">(Not until you can actually get to her.)</span>

(if: $lockJesseE is true and $lockJesseE1 is true and $storyAnts's medicine < 7)[<li>~~Give Jesse her medicine.~~ <span class="desc">(Not until you can actually get to her.)</span>]

(else-if: $storyAnts's medicine >= 7)[<li>~~Give Jesse her medicine.~~ <span class="desc">(You've given her everything you have.)</span>]

<li>(link: "Leave her be. At least there's food and a clean litterbox if she ever wants to go out again.")[(print: $actionBack's effect)] <span class="desc">(print: $actionBack's desc)</span>
</ol>


:: Jesse C2 {"position":"5950,1850","size":"100,100"}
{=

<!--Morning passages-->

(if: $time is "Morning" and $lockJesseE is true and $lockJesseE1 is false)[

(set: $activity to "looking for Jesse")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

The coast may be clear, but Jesse is not out of the weeds yet. It seems like everyday, a new sore opens. Maybe there's an infection, or maybe she just needs to stop scratching herself.
<br>
Either way, you'll need a professional opinion about the matter.
<br>
---
<ol>
You...
<li>(link: "Take Jesse to the vet.")[(goto: "Jesse E1")] <span class="desc">(print: $actionCommit's desc)</span> <!--[[Jesse E1]]-->
