(set: _num to 0)
(set: _trigger to "(set: _num to it + 1)")

<li>(link-rerun: "Pack up your painting and leave for the bus station.")[_trigger 
	(if: _num is 1)[(dialog: [Are you sure? You've only set the bait and have no idea whether it will work as advertised. If it doesn't, then you are condemning Jesse to suffer.], "Don't you need to see the ants all dead?")]
	(if: _num is 2)[(dialog: [Yes, if you wait out the bait, you will be late, at most a day, but these rich types love to linger and dally. They won't suffer at your absence.], "But Jesse will if your ant bait fails.")]
(if: _num is 3)[(dialog: [Why do you insist on going while the ants still remain? Is this what you do, leaving things perpetually unfinished? Is it so that you never have to bear the outcomes of what you do?], "That sounds like you.")]
