(link-reveal: "//“Feeling alright, friend?”//")[ a muffled voice echoes between the tiled walls of the bathroom. You look up from the sink, face drenched, and see in the mirror that silver figure, flickering with the dilapidated light. //“You look like you’ve seen a ghost.”//
<br>
The motorcycle rider is a woman, you realize. Her helmet is still on, her visor a red tint. The silver full-body suit squeaks when she moves.
<br>
You mutter (link-reveal: "that you’re fine.")[
<br>
//“Where are you headed?”// she takes off her gloves and lets her sweat drip down the sink.

