<br>
The feathers rustle, as though she is chuckling. (link-reveal: "Ah, so that’s how it is.")[
<br>
You try again: There is a girl here among the crowd, but she is lonesome. Her countenance is so perfect that she must mutilate it so the angels - that hateful species - will not envy her. And now, she passes like a shadow, though she carries an invisible fire. You’re desperate to talk to her. What must you do?
<br>
More silence. You can feel those sharp eyes staring at you. You are here now; why must she play coy?
(link: "
<br>...")[(show: ?choices)]
