<li>(if: $lockPanicYou is false)[(link: "Retrieve your painting first.")[(goto: "Gala D4a")]](else:)[~~Retrieve your painting.~~ <span class="desc">(You don't know where it is, but you're hauling its vacuous sister instead.)</span>]<!--[[Gala D4a]]-->
<li>~~Go back to Katherine's space.~~ <span class="desc">(There is nothing there for you anymore, least of which is Kathrine.)</span>
