<br>
Perhaps for every ten BFA juniors, Amy is better than eight, but the other two - the truly good - neither sees art as a hobby or a future profession. Why, they might not even be that good with their hands.
<br>
(link-reveal: "Katherine comes to mind.")[ Her hands were not refined, but she used her entire body, her entire soul. One had the impression that she'd rather die than to phone it in. Katherine never needed your approval. You changed that.
