It is finally done. You might have irrevocably damaged Jesse's trust in the process. (if: $storyAnts's medicine < 6)[(link-reveal: "You'll have to do it again tomorrow.")[(show: ?again)]](else:)[(link-reveal: "But, that's the last of the prescription.")[(show: ?end)]]
