Is he being sarcastic? No, he's not. Henri seems to take your hermitude as a sign of consummate virtue. He makes you forget that you're supposed to feel bad for not showing up, or that you don't really care enough to talk about it.
<br>
And so, you (link-reveal: "talk about it")[, if only to steer him away from flattery or from inquiring about your work.
