<br>
//"But you didn't. This hasn't happened yet."//
<br>
You look back. The toilet is clean. (link-reveal: "You are clean.")[
<br>
//"Yes, clean so far, but for how long?"//
<br>
(link-reveal: "Forever.")[
<br>
//"I'll hold you to your words, you know."//
