:: Ants C {"position":"6075,2050","size":"100,100"}
{=

(set: $activity to "thinking about eradication")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

<!--First time thinking about this-->
(if: $lockAntsC is false)[
No matter how many you kill, they are still there, (link-reveal: "waiting.")[ Waiting? No, that would be to assign intelligence to dumb automatas, of nothing more than self-congrugating Earth-matter. You have not killed them; you are only quieting loathsome dirt.]
<br>
Calm yourself, and think simply - so long as they exist, you cannot have peace. Jesse won't have peace. You need to be able to focus on your work, and Jesse still has a long, wonderful, ant-free life left to live. Their nonexistence is a precondition to this peace.
<br>
What to do?

(set: _todo to 0)
(set: _trigger to "(set: _todo to it + 1)(if: _todo >= 2)[(show: ?online)]")

<br>
