<br>
(if: $time is "Midday")[//"Hmm… you're lucky, then."//]
(if: $time is "Night")[//"Out at this hour? Hope he gets tipped well."//]
<br>
And with that, she leaves. You listen until her footsteps have stopped echoing from the stairwell. Then, you (link-reveal: "close your door and lock it tight.")[
