<br>
She is lying there on her side, beneath your painting, motionless. Her gemlike eyes stare straight ahead into the wall's corner. (link-reveal: "What's so interesting in there, little baby?")[ (if: $lockJesseE1 is true)[The plastic cone around her head is stained with foam and vomit.](else:)[The fur of her chin is matted with foam and vomit.] The fur under her tail is wet with her own urine.
<br>
Jesse, you silly old woman, (link-reveal: "you've made a mess of yourself!")[ Picking Jesse up, you notice that her entire body is stiff like a plank. Her four limbs are frozen in their crossed state. Her damp fur retains the flatness of the floor. (link-reveal: "A fake!")[
