	(else-if: $choiceJesseGala is "Amy" and $lockJesseAmyA is true)[ Jesse is with Amy. It must be heaven compared to this dump.]
	(else-if: $choiceJesseGala is "window")[ Jesse is sleeping, recuperating. The window stays open, but she won't even go near it. What a wicked test of loyalty.]
	(else:)[ Jesse is sleeping, recuperating.]
