:: Ants D {"position":"6450,2350","size":"100,100"}
{=

(set: $activity to "pondering the ant-free apartment")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

(link-rerun: "All is dead.")[(dialog: [Even in the most inhospitable deserts, or under the most crushing depths of the ocean, there is still life to be found. Not here though.], "Nothing that light can touch.")] This is what you wanted, isn't it?
<br>
Perhaps one day, you'll stop seeing specks moving on the blank walls, stop hearing a million little feet tapping on the floorboard, stop feeling every itch and shudder, stop holding your breath, waiting for it to end…
<br>
But today is not that day.
<br>
Today, you're (link-rerun: "alive")[(dialog: [It is likely that perception, or even consciousness itself, does not awaken when given a stimulus. Rather, it is already-always in a state of lucid and continuous hallucination - like ever-busy water - which external reality falls into like a pebble. Thus, we perceive these ripples in the water to be objects, to be thoughts.], "Inferences, all.")].
