There is no reason for you to be sweating so profusely, or for your throat to tighten up like so. If they're watching you - and they surely have been for years - they'll know that you've rarely left your apartment. You haven't done anything wrong. You (link-rerun: "didn't even go to the Greeting Gala")[(dialog: [You can always tell them that you //chose// not to. You did that on purpose, right? You have a reason, and that reason //can// be that you're being… conscientious about your public life.], "Just as you've promised.")].
