<!--dead-->[
<br>
(link-reveal: "//\"No…\"//")[ her voice is broken. //"No… No, it's only been… It couldn't have been… It's not my fault. It's not my fault. It's not… Ha… Haha… Hahahaha… HAHAHAHAHA…"//
<br>
You can't help but (link-reveal: "smile when you hear her rapturous laughter.")[ She sees it for what it is. You knew Amy had the eyes for it, despite your shortcomings. If anyone did, (link-reveal: "it had to be her.")[
<br>
//"Ha, I see it now… Auntie, what you did to uncle… I get it… Let's… let's get you out of here, Jesse. Let's see if there's any place that's still open. Yes, it'll be fine. It'll be fine. Everything will go back to - haha - normal."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "Shuffling")[ - the things you've packed for Jesse are being collected. Step, step, step, she steps towards the front door and (link-reveal: "slams it shut behind her.")[ Her laughter still echoes in the hallway.
<br>
You wait for it to die down completely before exiting the dark bathroom. Your entire body is giddy and tingling. Your //magnum opus// undulates its colors throughout your flesh.
<br>
(link-reveal: "Soon, she will return.")[ They all do, once they've tasted this most exquisite honey.
