:: Police D {"position":"4800,3725","size":"100,100"}
{=

<!--Dream, being arrested by the Suppression Bureau-->
(set: $lockPoliceD to true)
<!--Should produce an "ending" sequence-->

(set: $activity to "last night")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

(link-reveal: "Night falls.")[
<br>
(link: "Sleep…")[Sleep feels like wrestling with your own heart and fighting for your own breath.
<br>
(link: "Your mind…")[Your mind is an unaccountably capricious horse, which you tie to a palm tree. It grazes from the blue sand, grinding glass grains between its teeth.
<br>
You've settled down by (link: "the black oasis…")[the black oasis to wash the goat blood from your blade and armor.
<br>
(link: "The goat…")[The animal, its head still hanging onto its neck by a thin strip of flesh, is hogtied - for transportation, yes, but these things often get up and run in the night. It happened once. It won't again.
<br>
(link: "The wind…")[The wind is shrill against some far, towering rock, where blowing sands have carved curves and holes into the mineral, forming a lonely flute that sings for a thousand and one nights, until the instrument deforms yet further by the same invisible hand that has once made it so.
<br>
But tonight, its songs keep you (link-reveal: "awake in your tent.")[
<br>
---
<ol>
You…
