<br>
[]<responsenone2|
<br>
(link-reveal: "But you tell the woman none of this.")[
<br>
//"You're quiet. Why?"//
<br>
What is there to be said about that man that she (link-reveal: "hasn't already known?")[ You've been through this before. (link-reveal: "Her Bureau has got him.")[ (link-reveal: "He is dead to the world already.")[ What do she want with you? You're but an ant in her wake. She can crush you so easily and (link-reveal: "not waste anymore tax dollars.")[(show:?common)]
]]]]]<hiddennone2|(hide:?hiddennone2)
]

