//"Or do you need a visual aid?"// She asks, producing from the darkness (link-reveal: "a large panel.")[ Your painting, your //magnum opus//. Your beloved (link-reveal: "Sun.")[ It shimmers and shifts in the pale overhead lamp, becoming so bright that you must shield your eyes.
