Your hands are (link-reveal: "shaking uncontrollably.")[ You tuck them under your arms to still them, only to find that your heart is beating wildly against its cage. Your vision is pulsing, your eyeballs about to shove themselves out of their sockets.
<br>
(link-reveal: "What is this feeling?")[ It is as though a great danger is looming overhead, and the animal inside, free from illusions that things will work out for the better, desperately needs to (link-reveal: "run away")[, even if escape is impossible, for (link-reveal: "everywhere is a red color.")[ (link-reveal: "Fire.")[ (link-reveal: "Blood.")[ (link-reveal: "Siren.")[
