:: Gala Late C {"position":"6725,3525","size":"100,100"}
{=

(replace: ?date)[??]
(set: $time to "Dream")(replace: ?time)[$time]
(set: $place to "nowhere")(replace: ?place)[$place]
(set: $activity to "being questioned")(replace: ?activity)[$activity]

Before you is a metal table, lit by a single lamp. Your entire body is hurting.
<br>
(link-reveal: "//\"Hello, friend,\"//")[ out of the dark comes a woman's voice. //"Didn’t think we’d meet again so soon."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "You ask where you are.")[
<br>
//"Nowhere."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "You ask what the point of doing this is")[ - pulling you out from your cell in the small hours of the (link-rerun: "night")[(dialog: [Is it nighttime? Or is it day? There is no window, no clock in your cell.], "You only know the Sun's absence.")]. You've told her a thousand times before, and you will tell her another thousand times - that (link-reveal: "you've done nothing wrong.")[
<br>
//"Oh, I know. And I've told you just as many times, I'm not interested in (link-rerun: "persecutions")[(dialog: [If there's something concrete to persecute…], "... It's already too late.")]. It's prevention that's my goal."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "And how is that going for her?")[
<br>
//"Not going to lie: Not great."//
<br>
Aw, why is that? (link-reveal: "Dragging innocent people off the streets isn't improving the country as quickly as she thought it would?")[
<br>
She chuckles and stays silent for a moment.
<br>
//"No, believe me, no-one is innocent in this."//
<br>
In what? (link-reveal: "What is \"this\"?")[
<br>
//"This,"// you see the outline of an arm waving in the dark. //"What, have you been living under a rock?"//
<br>
Perhaps. Her Bureau would know; they keep tabs on you, that's no secret. But if no-one's innocent, (link-reveal: "does that include her as well?")[
<br>
//"Ha! I wish. But no, it's not my turn."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "What is //that// supposed to mean?")[
<br>
//"It means: it's my turn to ask the questions, not yours."//
<br>
It's been clear to the Bureau for years that you can't hurt anyone. All you do is paint, and barely even that. Isn't that why they've let you off the first time they've brought you in? (link-reveal: "What's the point of this interrogation? ")[
<br>
//"Interrogation? Is that what you think this is? I'm sorry, but you've misunderstood completely. This is a confessional. For you. Before the end."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "The end?")[ Is it time already?
<br>
//"Almost, but yes."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "Finally.")[
<br>
//"Oh don't be too hasty. There's always next time. Tomorrow always comes."//
<br>
Tomorrow, then the day after, and the day after that. You'll always give her the same answer: (link-reveal: "You've done nothing wrong.")[
<br>
//"Sin needs not knowledge."//
<br>
(link-reveal: "She sounds like a priest.")[
<br>
//"I told you this was a confessional."//
<br>
You hear in the dark paper being flipped. A button is pressed, and many small gears start to buzz.
<br>
---
(link: "\"Right, let's go over it again.\"")[(goto: "Gala Late D")] <!--[[Gala Late D]]-->
]]]]]]]]]]]]]]


:: Gala Late D {"position":"6725,3650","size":"100,100"}
