(link-reveal: "//\"Where to begin?\"//")[ She says, then stays silent, waiting for you to bite. You don't. She continues, (link-reveal: "//\"You were heading somewhere?\"//")[

[<ul>
<li>(link: "The Greeting Gala.")[(hide:?choices1)(replace:?response1)[The Greeting Gala - an art show funded by the Darkbloom Foundation. Outside of the arts, the Foundation has put a lot of money into this current government. (link-reveal: "This woman and her Bureau are in a large part bankrolled by them")[, that much is no secret, and you've hoped to be too. That hope diminishes the more time you spend in this dark room.
<br>//"Is that relevant? Were you hoping for some sort of immunity if you've sided with the 'right people'?"//
<br>No, of course not, because (link-reveal: "you weren't cognizant that you were doing anything wrong.")[
<br>//"It's hard to keep track of what's right and wrong these days."//
<br>She is silent again, listening to you (link-reveal: "squirm.")[(show:?hidden1)]]]]]
<li>(link: "An art show like any other.")[(hide:?choices1)(replace:?response1)[An art show, like any other. (link-reveal: "You are an artist, so you go.")[
<br>//"Like it's inevitable, like flies to honey and vinegar."//
<br>Of course, it is because you are innocent. And (link-reveal: "the innocent can only act per their nature.")[(show:?hidden1)]]]]
<li>(link: "Is that illegal now?")[(hide:?choices1)(replace:?response1)[You ask if it is illegal for you to go to an art show.
<br>//"Of course not. Legality has nothing to do with this, you know that."//
<br>(link-reveal: "It's true.")[ Perhaps the question was an instinctual bark of one constantly worrying. It is pointless to ask if you are being detained (you are, in fact), and it is pointless to ask under what charge (guilt follows for the (link-reveal: "most secret reasons")[(show:?hidden1)]).]]]
</ul>]<choices1|

<br>
[]<response1|
]]


[
<br>
//"What were you (link-reveal: "hoping to get out it")[(show:?choices2)] - being at the event, I mean."//
]<hidden1|(hide: ?hidden1)

[<ul>
<li>(link: "A career.")[(hide:?choices2)(replace:?response2)[A career, and the (link-reveal: "sustenance that came with it.")[ Yes, the well was drying up quick, even if you were frugal, but there was a different well that you needed to fill. With purpose.
<br>//"I thought you've promised to stay put."//
<br>From the halls of teaching, perhaps, but not from art itself. (link-reveal: "Never.")[
<br>//"One could disseminate many dangerous ideas outside of the classroom."//
<br>And art is one way - is what she means but chooses not to say. So you (link-reveal: "say nothing else to her.")[(show:?hidden2)]]]]]
<li>(link: "Recognition.")[(hide:?choices2)(replace:?response2)[What good is art if no-one sees it?
<br>//"I thought you were above that. Whatever happened to the solitary artist, making art for art's sake?"//
<br>(link-reveal: "There is no such thing.")[ (link-reveal: "Someone is always watching.")[ (link-reveal: "Someone is always listening.")[
<br>//"What about cave paintings? Our ancestors had no notions of galas and patronage. If the darkness of a cave is good enough for them, why not you?"//
<br>Because they had the light of fire, and (link-reveal: "their entire world was gathered there with them.")[(show:?hidden2)]]]]]]
<li>(link: "Escape.")[(hide:?choices2)(replace:?response2)[You wanted, if for one day, to be someone else. (link-reveal: "Don't we all?")[
<br>//"Speak for yourself. I'm perfectly happy the way I am. Not everyone is so discontented."//
<br>Truly? She'd rather be here in the dark, tormenting you, than to be out there, to be an actual person, to (link-reveal: "have a day in the light?")[
<br>//"... Well, no. It drives me crazy watching you. But it's my turn in the back office. We all have our places and our times. Some of us enjoy the hands we're dealt, and some of us squander it."//
<br>These are not the words of one who is (link-reveal: "content.")[(show:?hidden2)]]]]]
</ul>]<choices2|(hide:?choices2)

<br>
[]<response2|

[
<br>
//"If you wanted it so badly, (link-reveal: "why did you dither?")[(show:?choices3)] You wouldn't have made it in time."//
]<hidden2|(hide:?hidden2)

[<ul>
<li>(link: "You were negligent.")[(hide:?choices3)(replace:?response3)[Simple - you've neglected to notice the date.
<br>//"That's it?"//
<br>(link-reveal: "That's it.")[
<br>//"That's pathetic. Can't you do anything right?"//
<br>(link-reveal: "What difference would it have made?")[
<br>//"Always giving yourself excuses."//
<br>(link-reveal: "You're merely stating the reason.")[
<br>//"'Excuses' are reasons which we should be too ashamed to name."//
<br>(link-reveal: "You are not proud of it.")[
<br>//"And yet, (link-reveal: "you wear it like a badge.")[(show:?hidden3)]"//]]]]]]
<li>(link: "You were indecisive.")[(hide:?choices3)(replace:?response3)[You were indecisive. You wanted to go. You didn't want to go. Finally, you (link-reveal: "landed somewhere half-way.")[
<br>//"Half-way woman, that's what you are."//
<br>(link-reveal: "It's not always that simple.")[
<br>//"It is as simple as you make it to be."//
<br>Sometimes, you'd wake up and (link-reveal: "not know what to do.")[
<br>//"Of course you wouldn't. You can't do anything right, so you say that it's complicated."//
<br>(link-reveal: "You only want things to be perfect.")[
<br>//"Everything is perfect the way it is. It's only you that's a mess. Pity you'd have to (link-reveal: "make it everyone else's problem")[(show:?hidden3)] too."//]]]]]]
<li>(link: "You were arrogant.")[(hide:?choices3)(replace:?response3)[You really thought you'd make it, that it wouldn't be that bad, that you'd always be able to (link-reveal: "pick up the pieces.")[
<br>//"You're not young anymore. It's not right to think that."//
<br>But you've always been able to (link-reveal: "salvage things.")[
<br>//"Then you haven't learned anything. Don't you see? The world's only too ready to let you fail. Do you think you're special?"//
<br>Honestly? (link-reveal: "Yes.")[ (link-reveal: "Otherwise, you wouldn't be here.")[
<br>//"Do you have any idea how many people are here? Don't you realize how desperate things are?"//
<br>(link-reveal: "You really do not know.")[ You haven't paid attention to anything but yourself.
<br>//"Then you must at least know of your own desperation. If you weren't desperate, if you didn't… you would have died in Mexico City. Things didn't just turn out fine by themselves, (link-reveal: "did they?")[(show:?hidden3)]"//]]]]]]
</ul>]]<choices3|(hide:?choices3)

<br>
[]<response3|

[
<br>
You stare into the dark, looking for the face of your torturer but you see (link-reveal: "nothing.")[
<br>
//"Well, you wanted to be seen. Something ''has'' taken notice. Are you happy with what you've done?"//
<br>
(link-reveal: "Happy?")[ Can anything about yourself be considered (link-reveal: "\"happy\"?")[ Angry, impatient, you lash out: What is it with this moralizing talk? Has the Bureau abandoned its pliers and clamps, its water buckets and car batteries? (link-reveal: "Is this what your tax money is paying for - talk?")[
<br>
//"You keep insisting that the Bureau and I are one, and that gives you an excuse to deflect. It's better for you if you're honest, you know. Else, we're going to keep doing this over and over."//
<br>
You tell her again that you (link-reveal: "haven't done anything wrong.")[ It is plain - you're only a lonely woman living with her cat, separate from the affairs of the world - how could you possibly be of any interest to the Bureau?
<br>
//"There you go again. I said- You know what? How about this: The Bureau is no more. The Union is no more. Whatever you've done, you've already succeeded. There's nothing left but you and me. Now, would you be honest with me and confess?"//
<br>
You stammer, (link-reveal: "unable to comprehend what she is saying.")[
<br>
//"Or do you need a visual aid?"// She asks, producing from the darkness a (link-reveal: "large panel.")[ Your painting, your magnum opus, thought lost in the scuffle. Your beloved (link-reveal: "Sun.")[ It shimmers and shifts in the pale overhead lamp, becoming so bright that you must shield your eyes.
<br>
