"(link: \"Is it preferable to not have one's life prolonged at all?\")[_trigger]",
"(link: \"Does it not then follow that one ought to end such suffering at one's earliest convenience?\")[_trigger]",
"(link: \"It seems that no matter how precious, some are fated for wretchedness.\")[_trigger]",
"(link: \"How many ants have you killed and not spared a thought?\")[_trigger]",
"(link: \"How many more will you kill?\")[_trigger]",
"(link: \"Is it ever enough?\")[_trigger]",
"You've banished the thought.
<br>Jesse is rubbing her face against your leg.
(show:?hiddenAlive2)"
))

(set: _trigger to "(dialog: [], \"Banish the thought.\")(set: _num to it + 1)(replace: ?thinking)[(print: _thinking's _num)]")
<br>
You've rescued her from the streets. Since then, whether she lives or dies has been yours to decide. Often, more so these days, you'd catch yourself thinking… [that if the world is bad enough, (link: "is it preferable to not be born at all?")[_trigger]]<thinking|
]<hiddenAlive1|(hide:?hiddenAlive1)

[
<br>
---
<ol>
You…
<li>(link: "Play with Jesse.")[(set: $dice to (random: 1,2))(goto: "Jesse-End 1")] <span class="desc">(There's a chance that she doesn't want to play. Commit.)</span><!--[[Jesse-End 1]]-->
<li>(link: "Shake her off. You have other things to do.")[
	(dialog: [//"Miu? Miu?"// <br><span class="desc">(It hurts!)</span>], "Turn away.")
	(set: $mind to it - 1)(replace: ?mindStat)[$mind]
(print: $actionBack's effect)
]  <span class="desc">(print: $actionBack's desc)</span>
</ol>
]<hiddenAlive2|(hide:?hiddenAlive2)
]<!--end of alive passage-->

<!--Dead passage-->
(else:)[
... Who? What for? Ah, you forget.
<br>
(link-reveal: "Your mind is foggy as of late.")[ You can't keep anything straight, and you often find yourself in the middle of doing something, but you cannot remember what. Awareness is like lonesome islands in a misty sea.
<br>
---
<ol>
(set: _num to 0)
(set: _remember to (a:
"Here, there, everywhere are silky clumps of fine little hairs.",
"The food bowl, it has been emptied, right? Did you fill it? Was it like this the other day?",
"The stuffed mouse - it has been kicked around, yes? Perhaps only by you…",
"You remember waking up in terror. It was because…",
"You were happy.",
))

(set: _trigger to "(set: _num to it + 1)(if: _num >= 5)[(replace: ?remember)[<li>~~You can try to remember.~~ <span class=\"desc\">(Evidently not.)</span>]](print: _remember's _num)")

But…
[<li>(link-rerun: "You can try to remember.")[(set: $mind to it - 1)(replace: ?mindStat)[$mind](dialog: [_trigger <br><span class="desc">(It hurts.)</span>], "You lose your train of thought.")]  <span class="desc">(Are you ''sure''?)</span>]<remember|

<li>(link: "Perhaps some things are better buried and forgotten.")[
(dialog: [No matter how precious. <br><span class="desc">(Like a quiet shoebox, buried somewhere in the park.)</span>], "No matter… You'll live.")
(set: $mind to it - 1)(replace: ?mindStat)[$mind]
(print: $actionBack's effect)
] <span class="desc">(print: $actionBack's desc)</span>
</ol>
]]<!--end of dead passage-->


