The laptop coughs and wheezes as you rouse it from its deathbed.
<br>
(if: $choiceJesseGala is "none")[//"Everyone has one these days,"// he continued, much to your annoyance. //"Forget Chicago. Maybe you'll meet someone online who's in need of a… mentor. There's never a shortage."//](else:)[Admit it: You've never had an idea of your own that you haven't gotten from the internet. This was the best gift anyone has ever given to you. You've never admitted this.]
