(link: "Flesh…")[_trigger Impressions of flesh churn together in a mechanical mill. ]
(link: "Hair…")[_trigger Long hair, short hair, black hair, dyed hair, wavy hair, kinky hair, buzz cut, bob cut, blunt bangs, streaks of red and streaks of blue, all caught in the shifting folds of ample skin and matted in the sweat that humans cannot help but ooze. ]
(link: "Fluids…")[_trigger Prodigious pools drip down onto the floor and splash and splatter and darken the world in a vulgar flood. ]
(link: "Everywhere…")[_trigger Once-daughter, once-mother, once-son, once-father, now is everything and is everywhere, all together, and never again whole. ]
(link: "Forever…")[_trigger As long as the machine runs, there will be more flesh. With squinted eyes, it dreams of flesh. With a glowing box, it finds its flesh. With an glowing white, there is now flesh in the soil. There was a man in Ukraine - he is no more. There was a woman in Palestine - she is no more. There were children here in the Union - they are no more. ]
(link: "Always.")[_trigger The last remaining images of humanity - once made, never forgotten. There is always someone watching. There is always someone listening. ]
]<hidden1|(hide:?hidden1)

[
<br>
After the internet went down, and everything else was gone, this is all you ever look at. Does it scratch your itch? Do you have permission to go back to sleep now? Beside, how is this thing (link-rerun: "still running?")[(dialog: [You feel like a mosquito sucking on the last vile drops in a carcass.], "You, too, are drained.") It doesn't matter.
<br>
---
<ol>
<li>(link: "None of this does.")[
(print: $attRestlessness's gainEffect)
(print: $actionOnward's effect)
] <span class="desc">(print: $attRestlessness's gain)</span>
<li>(link: "Which is what you tell yourself.")[
(print: $attEmbarrassed's gainEffect)
(print: $actionOnward's effect)
] <span class="desc">(print: $attEmbarrassed's gain)</span>
]]<hidden2|(hide:?hidden2)


