You know how to do this. Of course you do. The way has been illuminated in your sleep, and you've dreamt of how your hands will (link-reveal: "move")[(show:?hands)], how the colors will  (link-reveal: "form upon the canvas")[(show:?form)], even how it will  (link-reveal: "smell")[(show:?smell)].

(set: _num to 0)
(set: _trigger to "(set: $mind to it - 1)(replace: ?mindStat)[$mind](dialog: [And everything is right in the world. <br><span class=\"desc\">(Everything still hurts.)</span>], \"Everything,  right where it belongs.\")(set: _num to it + 1)(if: _num >= 3)[(show:?done)]")

[
<br>
(link-reveal: "And how will your hands move?")[(either:
" By the principle of correspondence - as above, so below. They will move with the course of the stars and the rolling of the planets. And (link-reveal: \"the heavens are frantic right now.\")[_trigger]",
" Lovingly. Like a butcher's before the bolt comes down and the hooks come out. The child knows not what to expect. (link-reveal: \"It only expects to be born.\")[_trigger]",
" Methodically, by tracing the lines from a lost memory and uncovering from the Earth the face of (link-reveal: \"that which was once dearly loved.\")[_trigger]",
)]]<hands|(hide:?hands)

[
<br>
(link-reveal: "And how will the colors form?")[(either:
" Like an oil spill. Like a wildfire. Like a (link-reveal: \"metastasizing mole.\")[_trigger]",
" Layer by layer, like skin upon flesh, flesh upon bone, bone upon marrow, marrow upon nothing. It is (link-reveal: \"blindingly dark inside everyone.\")[_trigger]",
" Like something that can only be seen with squinted eyes. You see it, don't you? Here, look. Yes, it is… Ah, yes. More, yes, more… (link-reveal: \"Ah…\")[_trigger]",
)]]<form|(hide:?form)

[
<br>
(link-reveal: "Smell? How will it smell?")[(either:
" One would think sulfur, and if that's what one believes, then it //will// smell of sulfur. That is how all dreams work - lakes of burning sulfur and red nymphs (link-reveal: \"skinny-diving and roasts.\")[_trigger]",
" Like the un-insides of oysters. Like falling to a tragically early sleep, right at the heights of joy. Like (link-reveal: \"missing someone you've never met.\")[_trigger]",
" Like you. It is (link-reveal: \"//all// you.\")[_trigger]",
)]]<smell|(hide:?smell)

[
<br>
Some light has (link-reveal: "left your mind")[(show:?hidden)] by way of your trembling and bloodied fingers.
