(set: _num1 to (random: 1,3))
(if: _num1 is 1)[(link: "See how easy things are?")[ Your fury is what will puncture the curtain of doubt which has blinded you._trigger(show:?line2)]]
(if: _num1 is 2)[(link: "Put yourself aside.")[You are your greatest distraction and your greatest detractor. You are a mere set of eyes and hands, from which //will// flows into the world._trigger(show:?line2)]]
(if: _num1 is 3)[(link: "Punish it.")[ Whip it, strike it, claw at it, as though it were your own hateful skin. You hate it; it is so ugly. You will make it beautiful, but first, everything about it must be shed._trigger(show:?line2)]]
