[<!--2nd line-->
(set: _num2 to (random: 1,3))
(if: _num2 is 1)[(link: "Don't you see how beautiful you are?")[ You are the loveliest when you suffer._trigger(show:?line3)]]
(if: _num2 is 2)[(link: "It's too bad that it doesn't come often enough.")[ If only you could be this way forever._trigger(show:?line3)]]
(if: _num2 is 3)[(link: "This world deserves your violence.")[ Anything less is unworthy of existence._trigger(show:?line3)]]
<br>
]<line2|(hide:?line2)

[<!--3rd line-->
(set: _num3 to (random: 1,3))
(if: _num3 is 1)[(link: "On and on, until there is nothing left.")[ You keep going until it is perfect, or until you are perfectly spent._trigger(show:?done)]]
(if: _num3 is 2)[(link: "Louder, louder!")[ Louder, until the heavens hear you and come down upon you._trigger(show:?done)]]
(if: _num3 is 3)[(link-reveal: "You will have a good sleep tonight.")[ If it is ever night._trigger(show:?done)]]
<br>
