Amy has been […]<response|
[<ul>
<li>(link: "Magnificent.")[(hide:?choices)(show:?hidden3)(replace:?response)[... magnificent. The woo-woo types say that we're all made of star-stuff, but they often forget what a violent and horrible thing a star's existence is - to live with a weight so heavy that it crushes into iron - to die showering the world with gold. Some will carry more horror than others. Such is the source of their light.]]
<li>(link: "Full of vitality.")[(hide:?choices)(show:?hidden3)(replace:?response)[... full of youthful vitality. Deny and beg and pray and cry, she may, but that fount will not stop flowing, for it is her nature, as it is the nature of all great things, to ceaselessly emanate outward.]]
<li>(link: "So accommodating.")[(hide:?choices)(show:?hidden3)(replace:?response)[... so accommodating. She aims to please. She aims to be valuable. Whatever dissent she has, she swallows and lets ferment. You were like that once, until you changed. With a some gentle nudging, she, too, will change.]]
</ul>]<choices|
]]]<hidden2|(hide:?hidden2)

